      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CRACKERJACK GUS (5) was well supported last time and rocketed out of the boxes with a strong early sectional, going on to clock 22.48 in a 1.75 lengths win at Geelong over 400m. The form out of the last run is proven to be strong. Form reads well for this. CONTACTED (2) has been out of the placings the last couple but was a Maiden H winner (30.52) three back at The Meadows. Expected to bounce back to best. MAXIMUM SUNNY (3) turned in a good run last time, finishing in the placings (24.02) at this track in a Grade 7. Lines up from box 3 for the first time. Can measure up. EYE OF STORM (1) can improve on an unplaced run here last time out.",
